# DVC
# website: https://dvc.org
# docs: https://doc.dvc.org/
# description: Ignores internal cache, temporary runtime files, and local configuration for Data Version Control (DVC).

# DVC cache and runtime directories
.dvc/cache/
.dvc/tmp/
.dvc/plots/

# Local configuration overrides (machine-specific paths and credentials)
.dvc/config.local